1
00:00:00,202 --> 00:00:05,332
Anyway, uh, you know
my act better than anybody...

2
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:08,700
(Arthur:)...I was hoping that
maybe you'd fill in for me.

3
00:00:10,245 --> 00:00:13,845
(Sheldon:)Are you saying that you want me
to be Professor Proton?

4
00:00:14,316 --> 00:00:17,216
(Sheldon:)- Yeah.
- Oh, my.

5
00:00:17,452 --> 00:00:20,352
What an honor.
Oh, this is like being asked to...

6
00:00:20,555 --> 00:00:24,215
(Sheldon:)...ascend Mount Olympus
and dine with the gods.

7
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:30,060
(Arthur:)Or a Korean family in Alhambra.

8
00:00:31,533 --> 00:00:33,903
(Sheldon:)But they'll know I'm not you.

9
00:00:34,102 --> 00:00:38,402
(Sheldon:)Should I call myself Professor Proton, Jr?

10
00:00:39,107 --> 00:00:40,407
(Arthur:)Sounds great.

11
00:00:41,209 --> 00:00:46,379
(Sheldon:)So in a way, it's like I'm your son.

12
00:00:47,415 --> 00:00:49,405
(Sheldon:)Whatever.

13
00:00:52,587 --> 00:00:54,247
(Sheldon:)Father.

14
00:00:57,759 --> 00:01:00,019
(Arthur:)Sure, what the hell.

